-## Target architecture
+# Research Roadmap V562: Certified Branch Advice and Continuous Structural Learning
+
+**Milestone:** 2026.08.562  
+**Date:** 2026-08-22  
+**Status:** Planned  
+**Experiments:** Exp6506-Exp6518  
+**Execution file:** `research-roadmap-next.yaml`
